The animated emoji in this directory are Noto Animated Emoji.

Copyright Google Inc.
Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Source: https://googlefonts.github.io/noto-emoji-animation/, fetched from
fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/latest/<codepoints>/512.webp

Modifications by Concord contributors (see frontend/scripts/prep-anemoji.mjs):
each animation is downscaled from 512x512 to 80x80, has every second frame
dropped with the per-frame delay doubled to preserve the original timing, and
is re-encoded as WebP at quality 38. Files are renamed to the codepoint
spelling the app's emoji renderer looks up rather than Noto's. Only a curated
subset of roughly 150 emoji is included, not the full set.

CC BY 4.0 permits these changes provided the licence is named and the
modifications indicated, which is what this file does.
